Third-party material bundled with this project:

- Facet icons are from Lucide, ISC licensed. See LICENSES/lucide.txt.
- Steam tag ids and names in src/data/steam-tags.json come from Valve's public
  tag list (IStoreService/GetTagList). Their classification into facets
  (src/data/tag-groups.ts) and all tag blurbs are this project's own work.
- Master plot titles are the taxonomies of Christopher Booker, The Seven Basic
  Plots, and Ronald B. Tobias, 20 Master Plots; the descriptions in
  src/data/master-plots.ts are this project's own summaries.
